# Google Maps JavaScript API key.
# The app is fully usable WITHOUT this — it falls back to a built-in schematic map.
#
# To get one:
#   1. https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials
#   2. Enable "Maps JavaScript API" only. Do NOT enable Routes or Distance Matrix —
#      RouteForge never calls them, and leaving them off is your billing guardrail.
#   3. Restrict the key to HTTP referrers: http://localhost:3000/* and your domain.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
